== Installation ==

**How to Add Google Maps plugin to WordPress - Automatic Installation (Recommended)**

1. Go to `Plugins > Add New`
2. Search for "Elfsight Google Maps" and install the plugin
3. Activate your plugin

**Manual Installation**

1. Download `elfsight-google-maps.1.5.1.zip` from `wordpress.org` and unzip it
2. Upload the `elfsight-google-maps` folder to `/wp-content/plugins/`
3. Go to `Plugins > Installed Plugins` and activate the newest plugin

= Manage Elfsight Google Maps =

After installation there are only few steps left before starting to use the plugin and to embed the map to your website.

1. Click 'Google Maps' in WordPress menu to go to the plugin's page.
2. Use the editor to create and setup your first widget.
3. Copy-paste the widget's installation code into any place of your website.


